{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"紧绷的肩膀终于松开，胸腔打开\",\"source\":\"像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把肩膀松开、胸腔打开作为听感比喻，屏幕稿去掉比喻标记并放进人物叙述，变成了他实际发生的身体动作。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"铺开的力量仿佛短暂悬在半空，像在等待下一股浪潮；……像刚从梦里漂着 忽然一下落回现实\",\"source\":\"刚才近乎失重、像在梦里漂着，到了第84小节，同一艘船、同一首歌忽然变得异常直接、异常现实。到第92小节附近，刚才铺开的力量仿佛短暂地悬在半空，像在等待下一股更大的浪潮。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先写第84小节从梦境般的失重转为直接现实，再写第92小节力量悬置；屏幕稿把悬置放在前面、落回现实放在最后，颠倒了音乐进程。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "395a5ba3-2124-42ce-baac-6a595035f3b5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T174226405133Z", "elapsed_seconds": 201.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T17:45:47.671694+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ad3dbef11b31f1c03bcf9b3debf6a006553832976c39c8bc913c49c5749889fd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144c